sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User/Agent
  participant UI as Vanilla JS UI
  participant PW as Playwright Recorder
  participant API as Supabase/PostgREST
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant CR as pg_cron

  U->>UI: click "Tohumlama Kaydet"
  PW-->>PW: step_id + before state/IDB hash
  UI->>API: POST /rest/v1/rpc/save_insemination
  PW-->>PW: request ↔ step correlation
  API->>DB: execute RPC
  DB-->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE + trigger(s)
  DB-->>API: response
  API-->>UI: result
  PW-->>PW: after state/IDB hash + screenshot
  CR->>DB: scheduled task producer
  PW-->>PW: later DB/UI observation
